  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Physical or administrative constraints on Gulf oil exports increase competition between the U.S. and China for secure energy supplies and influence with producer states, elevating bilateral rivalry.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_war_stalemate</data>
