  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Elevated risk of maritime transit interruptions pushes firms to shorten and regionalize sourcing, increasing concentration of critical semiconductor suppliers and production in a smaller set of 'trusted' locations.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_war_stalemate</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_rivalry</data>
