  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in staple commodity prices lift inflation expectations and inflation risk premia, which market participants price into nominal long-term sovereign yields, pushing those yields higher.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_tension</data>
</edge>
