  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in global staple commodity prices transmits directly into higher food and transport costs in Iran, amplifying cost-of-living stress and the likelihood of protests and political unrest.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_war_stalemate</data>
</edge>
