  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Clear hawkish monetary signaling that tightens financial conditions and strengthens the dollar increases the effectiveness and political appetite for financial coercion, enabling states and banks to intensify sanctions, transaction blocks, and other forms of economic warfare against Iran.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
