  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in clear hawkish monetary signaling (strong, credible tightening guidance) strengthens the dollar and triggers risk‑off positioning that reduces demand and downward pressure on global agricultural commodity prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_tension</data>
