  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A fall in bond market liquidity tightens short‑term trade finance and increases the cost/availability of maritime insurance and working capital for exporters, causing immediate reductions in the volume of agricultural exports that can be funded and shipped.</data>
