  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Accelerated, contested transfers of energy assets increase uncertainty over long-term supply and cash flows, boosting risk/term premia that push long-term interest rates higher.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_tension</data>
</edge>
<edge source="energy_market_shift::asset_transfer_flow" target="iran_war_stalemate::shipping_disruption" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid transfers and reflagging of energy assets and tankers to evade restrictions increase insurer refusals, port denials and inspections, elevating the risk of delays, seizures and route detours.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_war_stalemate</data>
</edge>
