  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid transfers of energy assets into state-aligned or sanctioned-insulated owners enable continuity of export operations and revenue capture that can be redirected to military spending and logistics for ongoing combat operations.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
