  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in foreign transfers of strategic energy assets to firms linked to a rival raises perceived national-security risk and triggers policymakers to tighten export controls on critical technologies to prevent leverage or leakage.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_market_shift</data>
